{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "hotspots_no_meta",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "No change stamps",
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": false
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "hotspots_no_meta_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "This catalog carries no change stamps yet. They are read during the XML import — import the solution again to see which objects are changed often and which are left unused."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "hotspots_filters",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Filter"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "view_state"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "hotspots_type_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "type_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All types",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "multiple": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "hotspots_file_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "file_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All files",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "multiple": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "NavButton",
                "id": "hotspots_filters_reset",
                "props": {
                  "label": "Reset filters",
                  "variant": "link",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "navigate",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "/dashboard/hotspots"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "FilterChips",
                "id": "hotspots_view_chips",
                "props": {
                  "param": "view",
                  "default": "hotspots",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "value": "hotspots",
                      "label": "Hotspots"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "stale",
                      "label": "Stale objects"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Markdown",
                "id": "hotspots_anchor_md",
                "props": {
                  "content": "Data state **{{anchor_label}}**"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "hotspots_overview",
        "props": {
          "span": 12
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "hotspots_kpistrip",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "kpis"
            },
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Hotspots",
                  "field": "hotspots",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "hotspots",
                      "params": {
                        "view": "hotspots",
                        "quadrant": "hotspot"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Changed often",
                  "field": "churn",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "hotspots",
                      "params": {
                        "view": "hotspots",
                        "quadrant": "churn"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Stable core",
                  "field": "core",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "hotspots",
                      "params": {
                        "view": "hotspots",
                        "quadrant": "core"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Cold & unused",
                  "field": "cold",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "hotspots",
                      "params": {
                        "view": "stale",
                        "state": "cold"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Unused, age unknown",
                  "field": "age_unknown",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "hotspots",
                      "params": {
                        "view": "stale",
                        "state": "unknown"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "hotspots_ranking",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Hotspots",
          "subtitle": "Top 10 % of their object type in saves and in references — fragile cores worth a review before the next change."
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "show_hotspots",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "hotspots_quadrant_chips",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "kpis"
            },
            "props": {
              "param": "quadrant",
              "default": "hotspot",
              "resetParams": [
                "page"
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "hotspot",
                  "label": "Hotspots",
                  "countField": "hotspots"
                },
                {
                  "value": "churn",
                  "label": "Changed often",
                  "countField": "churn"
                },
                {
                  "value": "core",
                  "label": "Stable core",
                  "countField": "core"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "hotspots_table",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "hotspots"
            },
            "props": {
              "density": "compact",
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortable": true,
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "searchable": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search object, type or file",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "name",
                  "label": "Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "modifications",
                  "label": "Saves",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "used_by",
                  "label": "Used by",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "at",
                  "label": "Last changed",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "marker",
                  "label": "Note",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "badgeTone": {
                    "Mass event": "warning"
                  },
                  "nowrap": true
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{uuid}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}",
                  "type": "{{type}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No objects in this quadrant match the filters."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "hotspots_stale",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Stale objects",
          "subtitle": "Objects no other object references, by the age of their last stamp — candidates for a clean-up."
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "show_stale",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "FilterChips",
                "id": "hotspots_state_chips",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "kpis"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "state",
                  "default": "cold",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "value": "cold",
                      "label": "Cold",
                      "countField": "cold"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "unknown",
                      "label": "Age unknown",
                      "countField": "age_unknown"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "active",
                      "label": "Recently changed",
                      "countField": "active"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "menu",
                      "label": "In a menu",
                      "countField": "in_menu"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "FilterChips",
                "id": "hotspots_years_chips",
                "props": {
                  "param": "years",
                  "default": "2",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "value": "1",
                      "label": "Older than 1 year"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "2",
                      "label": "2 years"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "5",
                      "label": "5 years"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "stale_table",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "stale"
            },
            "props": {
              "density": "compact",
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortable": true,
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "searchable": true,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search object, type or file",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "at",
                  "label": "Last changed",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "age_years",
                  "label": "Age (years)",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "name",
                  "label": "Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "modifications",
                  "label": "Saves",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "marker",
                  "label": "Note",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "badgeTone": {
                    "Mass event": "warning"
                  },
                  "nowrap": true
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{uuid}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}",
                  "type": "{{type}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No unreferenced objects in this state match the filters."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "hotspots_basis",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Data basis"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "view_state"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "hotspots_basis_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "**Used by** counts the distinct objects that reference an object through a where-used link — the same link roles as *Not referenced* in the references tab; self-references and privilege restrictions do not count. **Unused** therefore means *without a static reference*: names built by a formula, `ExecuteSQL` texts and calls from outside (server schedules, `fmp://` URLs, Data API) stay invisible. Layouts in the layout menu and scripts in the Scripts menu are reachable without a reference and appear under *In a menu*.\n\n**Saves** is the object's lifetime counter, robust against mass events; a paste or an import creates a new object with counter 1. A **high** value means the top 10 % of the object type, measured over the whole solution — filters do not move the thresholds. **Age** counts from the data state ({{anchor_label}}); when the last stamp is a younger mass event, the last real change is overwritten and the age is unknown. Ranked are scripts, fields, layouts, table occurrences, base tables, value lists, custom functions, external data sources and themes."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
